content.thinking:
Now the big one: ExposureServiceImpl. Changes:

1. Add new repos to constructor: WithdrawalRepository, WithdrawalItemRepository, ReceiptRepository.
2. apply(): use lockById for campaign (serialize with withdraw), check withdrawn version → 409.
3. New methods: withdraw, submitReceipt, settle, getWithdrawal.
4. expireIfDue(): after successful CAS to EXPIRED, mark snapshot item EXPIRED + completeIfAllTerminal.
5. Operation enum: add WITHDRAW, RECEIPT, SETTLE.

Details:

**apply** change:
```java
Campaign campaign = requireCampaignLocked(request.campaignId());  // lock campaign row
if (withdrawalRepository.existsByCampaignAndVersion(campaign.campaignId(), campaign.version())) {
    throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT, "campaign version withdrawn: " + ...);
}
```
Replace `requireCampaign(request.campaignId())` with locked variant. Keep requireCampaign for queryQuota (read-only-ish, no lock needed... it currently uses findById; fine).

**withdraw**:
```java
@Override
public WithdrawalResponse withdraw(WithdrawCampaignRequest request) {
    String fingerprint = request.withdrawalKey() + "|" + request.campaignId() + "|"
            + request.campaignVersion() + "|" + request.cutoffAt();
    return runIdempotent(request.requestId(), Operation.WITHDRAW, fingerprint,
            WithdrawalResponse.class, () -> {
                long now = clock.millis();
                Campaign campaign = campaignRepository.lockById(request.campaignId())
                        .orElseThrow(() -> new ApiException(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND,
                                "campaign not found: " + request.campaignId()));
                if (campaign.version() != request.campaignVersion()) {
                    throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                            "campaign version mismatch: expected " + campaign.version()
                                    + ", got " + request.campaignVersion());
                }
                if (withdrawalRepository.existsByCampaignAndVersion(
                        campaign.campaignId(), campaign.version())) {
                    throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                            "campaign version already withdrawn: " + ...);
                }
                Withdrawal withdrawal = new Withdrawal(
                        request.withdrawalKey(), campaign.campaignId(), campaign.version(),
                        request.cutoffAt(), WithdrawalStatus.SETTLING, now, null);
                try {
                    withdrawalRepository.insert(withdrawal);
                } catch (DuplicateKeyException duplicate) {
                    // withdrawalKey 或 (campaign,version) 唯一冲突
                    throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                            "withdrawal key or campaign version already exists: " + request.withdrawalKey());
                }
                List<Reservation> pending = reservationRepository.lockReservedByCampaignVersion(
                        campaign.campaignId(), campaign.version());
                List<WithdrawalItemResponse> items = new ArrayList<>();
                for (Reservation r : pending) {
                    WithdrawalItem item = new WithdrawalItem(
                            withdrawal.withdrawalKey(), r.reservationId(), r.campaignVersion(),
                            r.visitorId(), r.createdAtUtc(), r.expiresAtUtc(),
                            SnapshotItemStatus.SETTLING, null, null);
                    withdrawalItemRepository.insert(item);
                    items.add(WithdrawalItemResponse.from(item));
                }
                return WithdrawalResponse.from(withdrawal, items);
            });
}
```

Wait — the existsByCampaignAndVersion check + insert unique constraint both present; the pre-check gives a nicer message but concurrent duplicates hit the constraint. Both fine.

Note: withdrawalKey uniqueness — if same withdrawalKey but different campaign → DuplicateKeyException → 409. Good.

**submitReceipt**:
```java
@Override
public ReceiptResponse submitReceipt(ReceiptRequest request) {
    String fingerprint = request.receiptKey() + "|" + request.reservationId() + "|" + request.occurredAt();
    return runIdempotent(request.requestId(), Operation.RECEIPT, fingerprint,
            ReceiptResponse.class, () -> {
                long now = clock.millis();
                // receiptKey 唯一：同键同参重放原决议，异参 409
                var existing = receiptRepository.findByKey(request.receiptKey());
                if (existing.isPresent()) {
                    ExposureReceipt receipt = existing.get();
                    if (!receipt.reservationId().equals(request.reservationId())
                            || receipt.occurredAtUtc() != request.occurredAt()) {
                        throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                                "receipt key reused with different parameters: " + request.receiptKey());
                    }
                    return ReceiptResponse.from(receipt);
                }

                Reservation reservation = reservationRepository.lockById(request.reservationId())
                        .orElseThrow(() -> new ApiException(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND,
                                "reservation not found: " + request.reservationId()));
                WithdrawalItem item = withdrawalItemRepository
                        .findByReservationId(request.reservationId())
                        .orElseThrow(() -> new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                                "reservation is not in a settling snapshot: " + request.reservationId()));
                if (item.status() != SnapshotItemStatus.SETTLING) {
                    throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                            "snapshot item already terminal: " + item.status());
                }
                Withdrawal withdrawal = withdrawalRepository.findByKey(item.withdrawalKey())
                        .orElseThrow(() -> new IllegalStateException("withdrawal missing: " + item.withdrawalKey()));

                boolean confirmable = request.occurredAt() >= item.reservedAtUtc()
                        && request.occurredAt() < withdrawal.cutoffAtUtc()
                        && now < item.expiresAtUtc();
                SnapshotItemStatus decision = confirmable
                        ? SnapshotItemStatus.CONFIRMED : SnapshotItemStatus.REJECTED;
                ReservationStatus target = confirmable
                        ? ReservationStatus.CONFIRMED : ReservationStatus.REJECTED;

                if (reservation.status() != ReservationStatus.RESERVED) {
                    throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                            "reservation is " + reservation.status() + ", cannot decide receipt");
                }
                if (!reservationRepository.compareAndSetStatus(
                        reservation.reservationId(), ReservationStatus.RESERVED, target, now)) {
                    throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT, "reservation state changed concurrently");
                }
                if (!confirmable) {
                    // REJECTED 释放两级额度；固定顺序先总账后访客账
                    ledgerRepository.releaseTotal(reservation.campaignId(), reservation.utcDate().toLocalDate());
                    ledgerRepository.releaseVisitor(reservation.campaignId(), reservation.visitorId(),
                            reservation.utcDate().toLocalDate());
                }
                if (!withdrawalItemRepository.decideIfSettling(item.reservationId(), decision, now,
                        confirmable ? "RECEIPT_CONFIRMED" : "RECEIPT_REJECTED")) {
                    throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT, "snapshot item decided concurrently");
                }
                ExposureReceipt receipt = new ExposureReceipt(
                        request.receiptKey(), request.reservationId(), request.occurredAt(), decision, now);
                receiptRepository.insert(receipt);
                withdrawalRepository.completeIfAllTerminal(withdrawal.withdrawalKey(), now);
                return ReceiptResponse.from(receipt);
            });
}
```

Hmm — one issue: reservation.status() check then CAS is redundant but harmless (CAS is the guard). Also note: if reservation already terminal but item still SETTLING — can that happen? Item decided only together with reservation CAS in same tx. Expiry: expireIfDue CASes reservation to EXPIRED then marks item. So they're consistent within tx. If reservation terminal and item SETTLING → shouldn't happen; the 409 above covers it defensively.

Also the DuplicateKeyException from receiptRepository.insert (concurrent same receiptKey) → caught by runIdempotent's catch → retries → finds existing receipt → returns or 409. Good.

**settle**:
```java
@Override
public WithdrawalResponse settle(String withdrawalKey, SettleWithdrawalRequest request) {
    List<String> sortedKeys = request.items().stream()
            .map(k -> k.reservationId() + ":" + k.campaignVersion())
            .sorted()
            .toList();
    String fingerprint = withdrawalKey + "|" + String.join(",", sortedKeys);
    return runIdempotent(request.requestId(), Operation.SETTLE, fingerprint,
            WithdrawalResponse.class, () -> {
                long now = clock.millis();
                Withdrawal withdrawal = withdrawalRepository.lockByKey(withdrawalKey)
                        .orElseThrow(() -> new ApiException(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND,
                                "withdrawal not found: " + withdrawalKey));
                List<WithdrawalItem> allItems = withdrawalItemRepository.findByWithdrawalKey(withdrawalKey);

                // 校验提交的集合与快照完全一致
                Set<String> expected = allItems.stream()
                        .map(i -> i.reservationId() + ":" + i.campaignVersion())
                        .collect(toSet());
                Set<String> submitted = request.items().stream()
                        .map(k -> k.reservationId() + ":" + k.campaignVersion())
                        .collect(toSet());
                if (!expected.equals(submitted)) {
                    throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                            "settlement set does not match snapshot for withdrawal: " + withdrawalKey);
                }

                List<WithdrawalItem> settling = allItems.stream()
                        .filter(i -> i.status() == SnapshotItemStatus.SETTLING).toList();
                // 仍有可合法确认的项：保持 PENDING，整体不变更，返回 409
                for (WithdrawalItem item : settling) {
                    if (item.reservedAtUtc() < withdrawal.cutoffAtUtc() && now < item.expiresAtUtc()) {
                        throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                                "snapshot item still confirmable: " + item.reservationId());
                    }
                }
                // 释放所有已无法合法确认的未回执项
                for (WithdrawalItem item : settling) {
                    releaseUnconfirmable(item, withdrawal, now);
                }
                withdrawalRepository.completeIfAllTerminal(withdrawalKey, now);
                return loadWithdrawalResponse(withdrawalKey);
            });
}
```

Wait — issue: settle on already-COMPLETED withdrawal with matching set → settling empty → completeIfAllTerminal no-op → return current state (200). Good.

releaseUnconfirmable:
```java
private void releaseUnconfirmable(WithdrawalItem item, Withdrawal withdrawal, long now) {
    boolean expired = now >= item.expiresAtUtc();
    SnapshotItemStatus target = expired ? SnapshotItemStatus.EXPIRED : SnapshotItemStatus.REJECTED;
    ReservationStatus reservationTarget = expired ? ReservationStatus.EXPIRED : ReservationStatus.REJECTED;
    Reservation reservation = reservationRepository.lockById(item.reservationId())
            .orElseThrow(() -> new IllegalStateException("reservation missing: " + item.reservationId()));
    if (reservation.status() != ReservationStatus.RESERVED) {
        // 并发回执/到期已先行终态：整体回滚，由调用方重试
        throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                "reservation state changed concurrently: " + item.reservationId());
    }
    if (!reservationRepository.compareAndSetStatus(
            item.reservationId(), ReservationStatus.RESERVED, reservationTarget, now)) {
        throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                "reservation state changed concurrently: " + item.reservationId());
    }
    ledgerRepository.releaseTotal(reservation.campaignId(), reservation.utcDate().toLocalDate());
    ledgerRepository.releaseVisitor(reservation.campaignId(), reservation.visitorId(),
            reservation.utcDate().toLocalDate());
    if (!withdrawalItemRepository.decideIfSettling(item.reservationId(), target, now,
            expired ? "SETTLED_EXPIRED" : "SETTLED_NO_VALID_OCCURRENCE")) {
        throw new ApiException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT,
                "snapshot item decided concurrently: " + item.reservationId());
    }
}
